Where in the world are you? I know I have 8x some size 70-ish ns 72-pin FPM 
SIMMs (proobably double-sided) in my box of bits. If you can find out the 
exact requirements of your system I could dig them out and see what size and 
speed they really are.

If we have a winner, you can have them for the cost of shipping from western 
Finland, which may or may not be cheap (couriers are essentially arm and leg 
territory, but Posti are pretty ok).

Staffan



